{"product_id":"vgod-e-liquid-cubano-black","title":"VGOD E Liquid - Cubano Black","description":"\u003cp\u003eCubano Black is a crafted specialty and has been aged to perfection. It is handcrafted in limited quantities and pre-steeped for months to coalesce to perfection. BOLD is the word you will envision when the robust Cuban cigar flavor hits your palate commingling perfectly with hints of rich creamy custard. The only thing that you will be thinking of as you exhale this smooth, well-balanced flavor, is the anticipation of your next draw of Cubano Black by VGOD.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE-Liquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: \u003ca title=\"Vgod E liquid\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vgod-e-liquid\"\u003eVGOD E liquid\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Cubano Black E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Freebase E liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 6mg \/ 12mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"3mg","offer_id":41670489964599,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano Black - 3mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6mg","offer_id":41670489997367,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano Black - 6mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg","offer_id":41670490030135,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano Black - 12mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod_cubanoblack_3mg_eliquid.jpg?v=1756300732","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vgod-e-liquid-cubano-